 "October 30, 1941, US President Roosevelt approves one billion US dollars in Lend-Lease aid to the Soviet Union.<cr>Note Picture: A M3 'Stuart' light tank and a dismantled Douglas A-20 'Boston' aircraft on board a cargo ship.": "1941年10月30日，美国总统罗斯福批准向苏联提供十亿美元租借援助。<cr>注：图为货轮上的 M3「斯图亚特」轻型坦克与拆解的道格拉斯 A-20「波士顿」飞机。",
 "October 30, 1941, US President Roosevelt approves one billion US dollars in Lend-Lease aid to the Soviet Union.<cr>Note Picture: An M3 'Stuart' light tank and a dismantled Douglas A-20 'Boston' aircraft on board a cargo ship.": "1941年10月30日，美国总统罗斯福批准向苏联提供十亿美元租借援助。<cr>注：图为货轮上的 M3「斯图亚特」轻型坦克与拆解的道格拉斯 A-20「波士顿」飞机。",
 "First American daylight raids on occupied Europe begin in June of 1942. German air defenses increased in July to combat the growing intensity of the allied bombing campaign. <cr><cr>- Western Europe TB Air Defense Requirement increases to 85<cr>- Western Europe TB Night Air Defense Requirement increases to 59": "1942年6月，美军首次对德占欧洲实施白昼空袭。7月，德国加强防空，以应对盟军轰炸力度的上升。<cr><cr>- 西欧战区框防空需求增至 85<cr>- 西欧战区框夜间防空需求增至 59",
 "Established in Smolensk before Feb 1939. Became 7th Guards Rifle Division Sep 1941. Recreated Mar 1942. Mutinied near Stalingrad Aug 1942. Fought at Minsk and Stalingrad. With 3rd Shock Army of the 1st Belorussian Front May 1945. Disbanded in the summer of 1945 with the Group of Soviet Forces in Germany.<cr><cr><cr><cr> Entry courtesy of NotOneStepBack": "1939年2月前在斯摩棱斯克组建。1941年9月改称近卫第7步兵师。1942年3月重建。1942年8月在斯大林格勒附近哗变。参加过明斯克与斯大林格勒的战斗。1945年5月隶属第1白俄罗斯方面军第3突击集团军。1945年夏随驻德苏军集群解散。<cr><cr><cr><cr>条目由 NotOneStepBack 提供",
 "December 7, 1941 (December 8, Asian time zones), is a busy day for Japan:<cr>Imperial Navy launches an attack on Pearl Harbor<cr>Declares war on the United States and the United Kingdom<cr>Invades Thailand and British Malaya<cr>Launches aerial attacks against Guam, Hong Kong, the Philipines, Shanghai, Singapore and Wake Island<cr>Note: Picture of USS California (BB-44) slowly sinking": "1941年12月7日（亚洲时区为12月8日）对日本来说是忙碌的一天：<cr>帝国海军偷袭珍珠港<cr>对美国与英国宣战<cr>入侵泰国与英属马来亚<cr>对关岛、香港、菲律宾、上海、新加坡与威克岛实施空袭<cr>注：图为正在缓缓下沉的「加利福尼亚」号战列舰（BB-44）",
 "Soviet army enters Serbia and launches an offensive on Belgrade in conjunction with operations of Yugoslav partisans. <cr><cr>- Balkans TB air combat intensity increases to LOW (2)<cr>- Game Event Mainland Greece Liberated set to Active and event Date set to 17 days from the current date<cr>- Game Event Belgrade Liberated set to Active and event Date set to 21 days from the current date": "苏军进入塞尔维亚，与南斯拉夫游击队配合对贝尔格莱德发起进攻。<cr><cr>- 巴尔干战区框空战强度升至「低」（2）<cr>- 游戏事件「希腊本土解放」设为启用，事件日期设为当前日期后 17 天<cr>- 游戏事件「贝尔格莱德解放」设为启用，事件日期设为当前日期后 21 天",
 "Spring of 1944 introduces new long range fighters (P-51s) which are able to escort bomber groups all the way to their targets and back. The new fighters are powerful enough to engage the best of the Luftwaffe air forces. By mid-year, Germany reorganizes its Luftwaffe forces and ground air defenses to meet the new threat. <cr><cr>- Western Europe Air Defense Requirement increases to 270<cr>- Western Europe Night Air Defense Requirement decreses to 75": "1944年春季出现了新型远程战斗机（P-51），能够全程护航轰炸机群往返目标。新战机足以与德国空军最精锐的部队交手。到年中，德国重组其空军与地面防空力量以应对新威胁。<cr><cr>- 西欧防空需求增至 270<cr>- 西欧夜间防空需求降至 75",
 "Spring of 1944 introduces new long range fighters (P-51s) which are able to escort bomber groups all the way to their targets and back. The new fighters are powerful enough to engage the best of the Luftwaffe air forces. By mid-year, Germany reorganizes its Luftwaffe forces and ground air defenses to meet the new threat. <cr><cr>- Western Europe Air Defense Requirement increases to 255<cr>- Western Euorpe Night Air Defense Requirement decreases to 75": "1944年春季出现了新型远程战斗机（P-51），能够全程护航轰炸机群往返目标。新战机足以与德国空军最精锐的部队交手。到年中，德国重组其空军与地面防空力量以应对新威胁。<cr><cr>- 西欧防空需求增至 255<cr>- 西欧夜间防空需求降至 75",
 "Spring of 1944 introduces new long range fighters (P-51s) which are able to escort bomber groups all the way to their targets and back. The new fighters are powerful enough to engage the best of the Luftwaffe air forces. By mid-year, Germany reorganizes its Luftwaffe forces and ground air defenses to meet the new threat. <cr><cr>- Western Europe TB Air Defense Requirement increases to 270<cr>- Western Europe TB Night Air Defense Requirement decreases to 75": "1944年春季出现了新型远程战斗机（P-51），能够全程护航轰炸机群往返目标。新战机足以与德国空军最精锐的部队交手。到年中，德国重组其空军与地面防空力量以应对新威胁。<cr><cr>- 西欧战区框防空需求增至 270<cr>- 西欧战区框夜间防空需求降至 75",
 "The Allies capture the Abruzzo region. In the most mountainous areas of Abruzzo, more than half the width of the peninsula comprises crests and peaks over 3,000 feet (910 m) that were relatively easy for the Germans to defend. The spurs and re-entrants to the spine confronted the Allies with a succession of ridges and rivers across their line of advance. The rivers were subject to sudden and unexpected flooding, which constantly thwarted the Allied commanders' plans. <cr><cr>- Abruzzo region captured by the Allies": "盟军攻占阿布鲁佐地区。阿布鲁佐是意大利半岛山地最密集的地区，其宽度过半都是海拔超过 3,000 英尺（910 米）的山脊与山峰，德军防守相对容易。通往山脊的支脉与凹谷使盟军每前进一步都要翻越一道道山梁、跨过一条条河流。这些河流常突发洪水，屡屡打乱盟军指挥官的计划。<cr><cr>- 阿布鲁佐地区被盟军占领",
 "The Moscow Military District was a military district of the Soviet Armed Forces in World War II. During World War II the District formed three fronts, 23 armies, 128 divisions of all arms, 197 brigades of all arms for an approximate total of 4.5 million men. In 19445 alone the District sent 1,200,000 soldiers to the front. From summer 1945 to summer 1946, in order to supervise the demobilisation process, the District was subdivided into four: the Moscow, Voronezh, Gorki and Smolensk Military Districts.<cr><cr><cr>Entry courtesy NOSB": "莫斯科军区是二战期间苏联武装力量的一个军区。二战期间，该军区组建了 3 个方面军、23 个集团军、128 个各兵种师、197 个各兵种旅，总兵力约 450 万人。仅 1944 年一年，该军区就向前线输送了 120 万名士兵。1945 年夏至 1946 年夏，为监督复员工作，该军区被划分为莫斯科、沃罗涅日、高尔基与斯摩棱斯克四个军区。<cr><cr><cr>条目由 NOSB 提供",
 "The XI SS Corps was formed on July 24, 1945 from the remnants of the V Army Corps. It was attached to the 17th Army. On February 1, 1945 it was renamed the XI SS Panzer Corps and re-assigned to the 9th Army. It fought in Poland and was destroyed during the Battle of Berlin. The following units were attached to it at one time or another during its existence: 25th Panzergrenadier Division, 78th Volksgrenadier Division, 544th Grenadier Division, 545th Grenadier Division and the 712th Infantry Division.<cr><cr>As compiled by the editor.": "党卫军第11军于1944年7月24日由第5军残部组建，隶属第17集团军。1945年2月1日改称党卫军第11装甲军，改隶第9集团军。它在波兰作战，并在柏林战役中被消灭。在其存在期间先后配属的单位有：第25装甲掷弹兵师、第78国民掷弹兵师、第544掷弹兵师、第545掷弹兵师与第712步兵师。<cr><cr>编者整理。",
 "The First Moscow Conference took place from September 29 to October 1 1941. William Averell Harriman representing the US and Lord Beaverbrook representing the UK met with Joseph Stalin in Moscow. The discussions involved the promise of aid and support by the Allies to the Soviet Union in the common fight against Nazi Germany.<cr>Based on conference agreements, for the period of October 1941 through June 1942, the USA and Great Britain would provide monthly deliveries to the USSR of 400 airplanes, 500 tanks, antiaircraft and antitank guns, motor vehicles, aluminum and other metals. In return the USSR promised deliveries to the Americans and British of large quantities of raw materials needed for war production.<cr>Note: Picture is of William A. Harriman in 1941": "第一次莫斯科会议于1941年9月29日至10月1日举行。代表美国的威廉·埃夫里尔·哈里曼与代表英国的比弗布鲁克勋爵在莫斯科会晤约瑟夫·斯大林。会谈内容涉及盟国在共同抗击纳粹德国的斗争中向苏联提供援助与支持的承诺。<cr>依据会议协议，1941年10月至1942年6月期间，美国与英国将每月向苏联交付400架飞机、500辆坦克、高射炮与反坦克炮、汽车、铝及其他金属。作为回报，苏联承诺向美英交付大量军工生产所需的原料。<cr>注：图为1941年的威廉·A·哈里曼。",
 "The US Navy's operational command the Eastern Sea Frontier is responsible for the coastal waters along the Eastern Seaboard from Canada down to Jacksonville, Florida, extending outward into the Atlantic a distance of two hundred miles.<cr>In Spring of 1942 the command is desperately short on suitable escort vessels for convoy duty. Before additional escort destroyers can be provided, the command institutes an interim arrangement known as the 'Bucket Brigaid'. Vessels outside of harbors are placed in anchorages protected by netting after dark, and moved only under whatever escort is availble during the day.<cr>As word of this and similar measures reach German admiral Doenitz, he does not wait to test their effectiveness, but instead shifts his U-boats to a different area of the eastern Atlantic, where American anti-submarine measures are not as effective. His new area of operations includes the Bahamas, the Gulf of Mexico, the Yucatan Channel and areas around Cuba.<cr>As a result, in May more Allied shipping is sunk in the Gulf, especially off the passes of the Mississippi river, than off the entire Eastern Seaboard.<cr>Note Picture: Vice Admiral Adolphus Andrews, commander, Eastern Sea Frontier (EASTSEAFRON).": "美国海军的作战司令部「东部海疆」负责从加拿大到佛罗里达州杰克逊维尔的东海岸沿海水域，并向外延伸至大西洋两百英里。<cr>1942年春季，该司令部极其缺乏可用于护航任务的合适舰艇。在追加护航驱逐舰到位之前，司令部实行了一项临时办法，称为「水桶旅」。入夜后，港口外的船只被安置在用防潜网保护的锚地，白天则在任何可用的护航下移动。<cr>当这些及其他措施的消息传到德国海军上将邓尼茨耳中时，他并不等待检验其效果，而是把U艇转移到东大西洋的另一片海域——那里美军的反潜措施不那么有效。新的作战区域包括巴哈马、墨西哥湾、尤卡坦海峡以及古巴周边海域。<cr>结果，5月间在墨西哥湾（尤其是密西西比河河口附近）被击沉的盟军船舶，比整个东海岸还多。<cr>注：图为东部海疆司令、海军中将阿道弗斯·安德鲁斯。",
 "The Roper was an old 4-stack Wickes-class destroyer in the US Navy, later converted to a high speed transport and redesignated APD-20. The U-85 was a Type VIIB U-boat of Nazi Germany's Kriegsmarine and was assigned to the 7th U-boat flotilla.<cr>During the night of April 13/14 1942, the two vessels encountered each other in a deadly confrontation off the coast of US North Carolina.<cr>The U-85, while operating within visual distance of Bodie Island Light, was detected by the Roper. The boat attempted to run south on the surface and fired her stern torpedo at Roper when the range closed to 700 yards. Roper evaded the torpedo and U-85 turned sharply to starboard when the range closed to 300 yards. Roper illuminated the U-boat with her searchlight and observed men on deck near the gun whose firing arc had just been cleared by the course change. Roper raked U-85 with machine gun fire and scored a hit with a 3inch/50 caliber gun. She then dropped a pattern of 11 depth charges where U-85 had disappeared beneath the surface. The Roper attempted a rescue at daylight, but there were no survivors.<cr>The USS Roper was the first American ship to sink a U-boat.<cr>Note: Picture of USS Roper (DD-147) and USS Talbot (DD-114)": "「罗珀」号是美国海军一艘旧式的四烟囱威克斯级驱逐舰，后改装为高速运输舰，重新定级为APD-20。U-85是纳粹德国海军的一艘VIIB型U艇，编入第7U艇支队。<cr>1942年4月13日至14日夜间，两舰在美国北卡罗来纳州外海遭遇，展开了一场殊死较量。<cr>U-85在博迪岛灯塔的目视距离内活动时被「罗珀」号发现。该艇试图浮航向南逃逸，并在距离缩短至700码时向「罗珀」号发射艉部鱼雷。「罗珀」号避开了鱼雷；距离缩短至300码时，U-85急转向右。「罗珀」号用探照灯照亮U艇，看到甲板上有官兵正在那门因转向而刚让出射界的火炮旁。「罗珀」号以机枪扫射U-85，并用一门3英寸/50倍径火炮命中一弹。随后，在U-85消失的水面投放了11枚深水炸弹的散布。「罗珀」号天亮后尝试救援，但无人生还。<cr>「罗珀」号是美国第一艘击沉U艇的军舰。<cr>注：图为「罗珀」号（DD-147）与「塔尔博特」号（DD-114）。",
 "IMPORTANT: This scenario is considered to be superseded by the new \nCampaign End Conditions game option.  We strongly recommend using \nthat option along with the regular 1941 Campaign instead of using this \n\"No Early End\" scenario, but this scenario remains available for players \nwho prefer it.\n\n\nAuthor:  Trey Marshall - Great_Ajax\n\n\n*** This scenario removes Sudden Victory and Sudden Loss victory\nrules. The game will always continue on to either the 31 December\n1944 victory check, the fall of Berlin, or the end date of the\nscenario.\n\n\nHistorical Overview\n----------------------------------\nGermany and its Axis Allies embark on a blitzkrieg campaign to\ndestroy the Soviet Union only to be stopped at the proverbial gates\nof Moscow. Three and a half more years of bloody combat will follow\nbefore the hammer & sickle flies over the Brandenburg Gate.\n\nScenario Overview\n----------------------------------\nAxis Player:\n- Destroy the Red Army and decisively seize Moscow, Leningrad \n  and Rostov before the end of 1941.\n- APs/Turn: 14\n \nSoviet Player:\n- Initially delay and disrupt Axis offensives, then conduct a strategic \n  counter-offensive to destroy the Axis armies and seize Berlin.\n- APs/Turn: 20": "重要提示：本战局已被新的「战局结束条件」游戏选项取代。我们强烈建议在使用标准1941年战局时启用该选项，而不是使用这个「无早期结束」战局；不过本战局仍保留给偏好它的玩家。\n\n\n作者：Trey Marshall - Great_Ajax\n\n\n*** 本战局移除了「突然胜利」与「突然失败」规则。游戏将始终进行到1944年12月31日的胜利判定、柏林陷落或战局结束日期为止。\n\n\n历史概述\n----------------------------------\n德国及其轴心盟友发动闪电战企图摧毁苏联，却在莫斯科城下被挡住。此后又经过三年半的血战，「镰刀与锤子」红旗才飘上勃兰登堡门。\n\n战局概述\n----------------------------------\n轴心玩家：\n- 在1941年年底前摧毁红军，并决定性地夺取莫斯科、列宁格勒与罗斯托夫。\n- 每回合行政点：14\n \n苏联玩家：\n- 初期迟滞并破坏轴心国的进攻，随后实施战略反攻，摧毁轴心国军队并夺取柏林。\n- 每回合行政点：20"
}